flowchart TD
    A([Customer opens cart]) --> B[Check stock level]
    B --> C{In stock?}
    C -->|No| D[Out of stock]
    D --> Z([Finish])
    C -->|Yes| E[Compute shipping fee]
    E --> F[Choose a payment method]
    F --> G{Payment succeeded?}
    G -->|No| H[Show payment error]
    H --> F
    G -->|Yes| I[Create order]
    I --> J[Send confirmation]
    J --> K([Completed])
